cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  vn-gross-flows: a panel of Vietnamese open-ended fund flows from Appendix XXIV
  regulatory filings
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: 10thirtyLabs
    email: mai@10thirtylabs.com
abstract: >-
  A reproducible panel of Vietnamese open-ended fund flows built from Appendix
  XXIV of Circular 98/2020/TT-BTC, the Ministry of Finance template every
  licensed fund files each dealing period. Unlike commercial fund databases,
  which carry net flows only, this panel preserves the disclosed gross
  subscription and redemption legs as separate series. 3,860 fund-period
  observations across 19 funds and 4 managers, 2021-01 to 2026-08, every row
  satisfying the NAV reconciliation identity to zero dong, with every excluded
  row documented and a written reason.
keywords:
  - fund flows
  - mutual funds
  - Vietnam
  - frontier markets
  - flow-performance
  - regulatory disclosure
